sequenceDiagram
    participant CM as CronManager (sibling pod)
    participant Gate as eFTI Gate (admin endpoint)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Log as ECS JSON log

    Note over CM: Daily at an operator-chosen time (default 03:45 local).<br/>YAML schedule in docs/specs/deploy/cronmanager-expire.yaml.<br/>HTTP POST job — target = the gate's admin expire endpoint.

    CM->>+Gate: POST /api/v1/admin/expire-identifiers<br/>Authorization: Bearer ${BEARER_OPS_TOKEN}
    Gate->>Gate: Auth: literal compare with ARCHIVE_OPS_TOKEN env var
    Gate->>Gate: pg_try_advisory_lock(<expire-lock-key>) — returns TRUE
    Gate->>+DB: SELECT DISTINCT ON (dataset_id) *<br/>FROM consignments<br/>ORDER BY dataset_id, created_at DESC<br/>(filter: status='active' AND mode='road'<br/> AND transport_date + INTERVAL '14 days' < NOW())
    Note over DB: Uses idx_consignments_dataset_latest +<br/>idx_consignments_status_active partial index.<br/>Cabotage retention per Reg 2024/1942 Art 11(4).
    DB-->>-Gate: [550e8400-…, a1b2c3d4-…, c3d4e5f6-…] (latest rows)

    loop For each expired road consignment
        Gate->>+DB: INSERT INTO consignments<br/>(dataset_id, platform_id, gate_id, xml,<br/>status, mode, vehicle_plate, …,<br/>transport_date, expires_at, created_at)<br/>VALUES (… same as latest row, but status='inactive')
        DB-->>-Gate: new row inserted
        Note over DB: No UPDATE — append-only. The newly-inserted<br/>row becomes the latest for this dataset_id;<br/>reads picking DISTINCT ON now see status='inactive'.
        Gate->>Log: { event.action: "identifier.expire",<br/>efti.dataset.id: "550e8400-…", efti.expiry.reason: "cabotage_14d" }
    end

    Gate->>+DB: INSERT INTO jobs_execution_log<br/>(job_name, started_at, finished_at, status, details)<br/>VALUES ('expire-identifiers', $start, NOW(), 'completed',<br/>jsonb_build_object('expired_count', 3))
    DB-->>-Gate: ok
    Gate->>Gate: pg_advisory_unlock(<expire-lock-key>)
    Gate-->>-CM: 200 OK { expired_count: 3, duration_ms: 14210, dry_run: false }

    Note over CM: Non-road modes (maritime/rail/air/multimodal)<br/>are NOT expired — Reg 2024/1942 Art 11(4)<br/>cabotage retention applies to road only.<br/>Old (non-latest) consignments rows are archived<br/>nightly by a sibling CronManager job (Epic 26).
